  "voiceSummary": "Pl Industries Limited intimates an interaction with analysts and investors pursuant to Regulation 30(6) of SEBI LODR Regulations 2015. The meeting is scheduled for November 19, 2026. The event is a one-on-one session with ICICI Prudential Asset Management Company Limited. The venue is Mumbai. No unpublished price sensitive information will be shared during this interaction. The details are subject to change due to exigencies. The company secretary and compliance officer is Shruti Joshi.",
