  "sort_date": "2026-11-12 10:33:31",
  "symbol": "PIIND",
  "voiceSummary": "PI Industries Limited filed the transcript of the earnings conference call for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026. The call was held on November 05, 2026. Consolidated revenue for Q2 FY27 was Rs. 17,018 million, a 9% decline year-on-year. Gross margins were 49% with EBITDA at 14%. AgChem exports declined by 18%. Domestic Agri business grew by 19%. Global biologicals saw significant traction. The company launched its first new chemical entity, Pioxazon. Regulatory filings are progressing in other geographies. The company is building platforms in pharma CRDMO and specialty chemicals. The transcript is available on the company website.",
